---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import bgPattern from "../assets/bg-pattern.svg";
import profilePicture from "../assets/profile-picture.png";
import sectionGradient from "../assets/section_gradient.svg";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

// Welcome to Astro! Wondering what to do next? Check out the Astro documentation at https://docs.astro.build
// Don't want to use any of this? Delete everything in this file, the `assets`, `components`, and `layouts` directories, and start fresh.
---

<Layout>
	<main class="">
		<div class="">
			<div
				class="absolute -top-32 left-0 -z-10 h-[700px] w-full -rotate-6 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_101.73%_140.07%_at_30.39%_0.00%,_#1A1A1A_54%,_rgba(26,_26,_26,_0.50)_100%)]"
			>
			</div>
			<div
				class="absolute top-0 left-0 -z-10 h-[450px] w-full bg-(image:--gradient)"
			>
			</div>
			<section class="relative container mx-auto max-w-5xl py-32">
				<Image
					src={bgPattern}
					alt=""
					class="absolute top-0 left-0 -z-20 w-full opacity-25"
				/>

				<div class="grid items-center gap-12 md:grid-cols-2">
					<div class="z-10 order-2 md:order-1">
						<div
							class="border-s-1 border-b-1 border-white/50 py-8 ps-12 font-mono text-4xl text-white"
						>
							Hey, ich bin
						</div>
						<div
							class="flex flex-col items-start gap-10 border-s-1 border-white/50 py-8 ps-12"
						>
							<span class="text-primary font-mono text-6xl"> Tim </span>
							<button
								class="border-1 border-white/50 px-8 py-3 font-mono text-white"
								>Kontaktieren</button
							>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="z-10 flex justify-center md:order-2 md:justify-end">
						<div
							class="relative aspect-square w-full max-w-1/2 rounded-full md:max-w-96"
						>
							<div
								class="bg-background aspect-square w-full rounded-full border border-white/20 shadow-[0px_0px_36px_8px_rgba(0,0,0,0.25)]"
							>
							</div>
							<div
								class="backdrop-blur-blur absolute bottom-0 aspect-square h-full w-full rounded-full bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_100.04%_130.58%_at_31.37%_0.00%,_#D94A17_0%,_rgba(231.54,_85.68,_33.66,_0.55)_62%,_rgba(193.80,_133.96,_112.20,_0.10)_100%)]"
							>
							</div>
							<Image
								src={profilePicture}
								alt="Tim Schulz Portrait"
								class="absolute bottom-0 w-full rounded-full"
							/>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>
			<section class="container mx-auto max-w-5xl">
				<div
					class="inline-flex w-[1024px] items-start justify-start overflow-hidden bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_113.17%_241.11%_at_41.02%_112.41%,_rgba(26,_26,_26,_0.20)_0%,_rgba(126,_126,_126,_0.14)_100%)] p-8 shadow-[0px_0px_70px_10px_rgba(198,113,83,0.25)] outline-1 outline-offset-[-1px] outline-white/20 backdrop-blur-sm"
				>
					<div
						class="flex flex-1 items-start justify-start gap-16 overflow-hidden p-2.5"
					>
						<div class="flex-1 self-stretch p-2.5"></div>
						<div
							class="inline-flex flex-1 flex-col items-start justify-center gap-8"
						>
							<div
								class="justify-start self-stretch font-mono text-4xl leading-9 font-normal text-white"
							>
								Über mich
							</div>
							<div
								class="justify-start self-stretch font-sans text-base leading-normal text-white"
							>
								Ich bin Tim Schulz, leidenschaftlicher Softwareentwickler,
								spezialisiert auf Webentwicklung. Unter dem Einsatz moderner
								Webtechnologien setze ich informative Websites um und entwickle
								individuelle, interaktive Webanwendungen.
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>
			<section class="container mx-auto mt-32 max-w-5xl">
				<div
					class="relative inline-flex flex-col items-start justify-start gap-16 self-stretch"
				>
					<Image
						src={sectionGradient}
						alt=""
						class="absolute -top-0 -z-10 h-72 w-full scale-150 overflow-visible bg-center bg-no-repeat"
					/>
					<div
						class="justify-start self-stretch text-center font-mono text-5xl leading-[48px] font-normal text-white"
					>
						Skills
					</div>
					<div class="inline-flex items-start justify-start gap-4 self-stretch">
						<div
							class="inline-flex flex-1 flex-col items-start justify-start gap-4 self-stretch overflow-hidden bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_113.17%_241.11%_at_41.02%_112.41%,_rgba(26,_26,_26,_0.20)_0%,_rgba(126,_126,_126,_0.14)_100%)] p-8 outline-1 outline-offset-[-1px] outline-white/20 backdrop-blur-sm"
						>
							<div
								class="justify-start self-stretch font-['Fira_Mono'] text-4xl leading-9 font-normal text-white"
							>
								Websites
							</div>
							<div
								class="justify-start self-stretch font-['Fira_Sans'] text-base leading-normal font-normal text-white"
							>
								Seit einigen Jahren ist das erstellen von Webseiten meine
								Spezialität.
							</div>
						</div>
						<div
							class="inline-flex flex-1 flex-col items-start justify-start gap-4 self-stretch overflow-hidden bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_113.17%_241.11%_at_41.02%_112.41%,_rgba(26,_26,_26,_0.20)_0%,_rgba(126,_126,_126,_0.14)_100%)] p-8 outline-1 outline-offset-[-1px] outline-white/20 backdrop-blur-sm"
						>
							<div
								class="justify-start self-stretch font-['Fira_Mono'] text-4xl leading-9 font-normal text-white"
							>
								Webapps
							</div>
							<div
								class="justify-start self-stretch font-['Fira_Sans'] text-base leading-normal font-normal text-white"
							>
								Aute quis velit elit aliquip eiusmod eiusmod dolore tempor
								cillum mollit sit. Enim aute ad labore mollit voluptate et
								incididunt non ex pariatur ex sit commodo quis. Incididunt
								pariatur in commodo ad<br />proident id nulla officia cillum
								sint sunt adipisicing qui adipisicing. Consequat nulla velit
								occaecat est et culpa deserunt aute magna proident sunt aute
								labore dolore nisi. Amet quis eiusmod commodo adipisicing.
							</div>
						</div>
						<div
							class="inline-flex flex-1 flex-col items-start justify-start gap-4 self-stretch overflow-hidden bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_113.17%_241.11%_at_41.02%_112.41%,_rgba(26,_26,_26,_0.20)_0%,_rgba(126,_126,_126,_0.14)_100%)] p-8 outline outline-1 outline-offset-[-1px] outline-white/20 backdrop-blur-sm"
						>
							<div
								class="justify-start self-stretch font-['Fira_Mono'] text-4xl leading-9 font-normal text-white"
							>
								Beratung
							</div>
							<div
								class="justify-start self-stretch font-['Fira_Sans'] text-base leading-normal font-normal text-white"
							>
								Aute quis velit elit aliquip eiusmod eiusmod dolore tempor
								cillum mollit sit. Enim aute ad labore mollit voluptate et
								incididunt non ex pariatur ex sit commodo quis. Incididunt
								pariatur in commodo ad<br />proident id nulla officia cillum
								sint sunt adipisicing qui adipisicing. Consequat nulla velit
								occaecat est et culpa deserunt aute magna proident sunt aute
								labore dolore nisi. Amet quis eiusmod commodo adipisicing.
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>
		</div>
	</main>
</Layout>
